Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:06.05,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,100,750,4900,5400)}{\pos(640,422.666)}Episode 71\N\N\N\N\NThe Empty Fort Strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:13.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Ma Su repeatedly requested Zhuge Liang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:16.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to lead the defense of the crucial route of Jieting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:20.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,even offering his entire family's lives as collateral.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:27.85,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang, moved by his sincerity, appointed Ma Su the Chief General,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,with Wang Ping as Deputy General.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:37.93,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Leading a force of twenty thousand troops to defend Jieting against the onslaught of Sima Yi's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.40,0:00:43.97,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(992,488)}Mǎ Sù\NStyled:\NYòucháng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:45.43,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(877.333,168)}Jiētíng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Look at this place, so mountainous and remote. \NHow would the Wei army dare to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Adjutant, though the Wei troops may not come,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}we should still build a palisade,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:00:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}and set up camp on this crucial junction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.09,0:00:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismount!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14)}Set up our camp on the junction, and fortify the route!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.94,0:01:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Halt! How is the middle of this road a good place to set up camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}This mountain stands isolated beside the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}and is not connected to the other peaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.94,0:01:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Heaven has bestowed upon us this strategic spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}We shall set up camp on this mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.63,0:01:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Adjutant! If we set up camp on the route and construct sturdy fortifications,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}even with a hundred thousand troops, the enemy will not be able to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}If we abandon this crucial area and camp on the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}the Wei army will swiftly surround us on all sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.59,0:02:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}What are we to do in that situation!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}General, these are thoughts of womenfolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}The military texts say: When occupying the high ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}your advantage shall be overwhelming. If the Wei army challenges us,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}I'll make sure none of them leave in one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Adjutant, I have accompanied the Chancellor into many battles
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}and he has given me much guidance each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}In my opinion, this mountain is a death-trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}If the Wei army cuts off our water supply,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}our forces will fall into disarray without a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.48,0:02:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Hmph! Pass my orders, we shall ascend and make camp on the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Prepare plenty of rolling logs and arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.43,0:02:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}When the Wei troops arrive, we shall strike them from the high ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.77,0:02:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Adjutant! Before the Chancellor departed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}he emphasized on having us set up camp on the route.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Then, intercept the Wei army.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}I maintain that we should heed his instructions
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}and construct palisades to fortify the junction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.39,0:03:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}General Wang, a military officer ought to have a keen eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.17,0:03:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}and adapt to different situations, deploying troops according to the terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}The Chancellor was unaware of this mountain, thus instructed us to make camp on the route.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Yet observe this excellent terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}This enables us to both mount overwhelming attacks and establish rock-solid defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}If we let enemy forces occupy this strategic spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}we will be at a huge disadvantage in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}hence why I shall occupy it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}If the Chancellor were here, he would do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Issue my order: All forces ascend and make camp on the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.40,0:03:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.74,0:03:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Adjutant, I still maintain it is safer to set up camp on the route!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}General Wang, you only know one side of the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Haven't you heard of Sun Tzu's saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.90,0:04:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Put the army in a desperate situation and they shall fight to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}If the Wei troops cut off our water supply, putting us in a life-or-death situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.05,0:04:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}won't our forces be driven to fight, \Neach man standing up to a hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.01,0:04:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}I have long studied military strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}and even the Chancellor asks me for advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Why are you obstructing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}If you insist on camping on the mountain, at least give me half of the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Nonsense! How can one army be divided into two?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}This is the Chancellor's order!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You-!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I shall set up my own camp to the west of the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}coordinating our flanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Adjutant, we can hence support each other if the Wei army comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! Adjutant, the Wei army is approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.76,0:04:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-How far are they? \N-Less than ten {\i1}li!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Order the troops to the mountain, and prepare for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you do not heed my words, take five thousand soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and set up your own camp off the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.84,0:05:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When I defeat the Wei army,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,don't think about getting any credit from the Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:07.80,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(957.333,469.333)}Wáng Píng\NStyled: Zǐjūn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.84,0:05:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My only aim is to prevent the loss of Jieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not seek such unreal achievements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Off the mountain with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Any signs of Shu forces? \N-Their soldiers are already at Jieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:40.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(333.333,498.667)}Sīmǎ Yì\NStyled: Zhòngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the troops halt the advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.54,0:05:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Zhuge Liang did anticipate that I plan to take Jieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A divine foresight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.27,0:05:54.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(373.333,505.333)}Sīmǎ Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐshàng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, why do you glorify him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking Jieting is not difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make wild boasts, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's no fortifications on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy are instead camping on that mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Wei army approaches, look for me waving a red flag on the summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, charge down from all sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The majority of the Shu soldiers are camped on that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is leading them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The younger brother of Ma Liang, Ma Su.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This man's reputation is hollow. In reality, he's a mediocrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it not Heaven's gift to us that Zhuge Liang has sent him to defend Jieting?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu forces are also commanded by a Deputy General, called Wang Ping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he camped?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten {\i1}li{\i0} from this mountain, with thousands of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:07:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my order: General Zhang He shall take a contingent to obstruct Wang Ping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The majority of our forces shall encircle this mountain tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and cut off the Shu troops' water supply. \NLet them descend into chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.85,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time is right, we shall light fires around the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and annihilate the trapped Shu forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly deliver this map of Jieting's terrain to the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.61,0:07:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief-Commander Sima orders: Guard this stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We must starve the Shu forces on the mountain to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:10.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The Wei troops are encircling our mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not panic! Do not panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:38.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(309.333,500)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.81,0:08:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.64,0:08:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Su made camp on the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he not make camp on the route!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:53.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(293.333,493.333)}Yáng Yí\NStyled: Wēigōng
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sima Yi arrives and surround the mountain completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,then cut off the water supply,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:09:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,it wouldn't even take two days for our forces to descend into disarray!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ch-Chancellor-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If he then lights fires around the mountain...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then our army will be-!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Release the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The stream is taken by Wei troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly retreat up the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Su's foolishness is going to bring disaster to our army...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:10:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, though I'm of lacking talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to ride to Jieting immediately to replace Adjutant Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Once you arrive at Jieting,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,withdraw our troops to the junction immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and make camp on the route. Remember, on the route!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, Chancellor. I, Yang Yi shall depart!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Combine your forces with General Wang and resist the enemy together...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You, lead the men to drive back the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:33.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.97,0:10:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Our forces have surrounded the mountain like a metal barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:10:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.54,0:11:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't! We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,our water supply has been cut by the Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How can our men fight when we are suffering from thirst?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Light fires and burn the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! They are burning the mountain! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not panic, listen to my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Old bastard Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me to battle! Cowards will be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei forces are burning the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Adjutant is in peril! We must ride to his rescue!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wang Ping! I, Zhang He, have awaited you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:51.15,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1005.333,426.667)}Zhāng Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.54,0:13:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Old bastard Sima!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.41,0:13:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let loose the arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge! Charge down the mountain! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.72,0:13:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge down! Charge even if you can't charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Jieting cannot be lost! It cannot be lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant, the Wei are too numerous and fire is burning everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't charge! We can't push through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge even if you cannot push through! \NJieting cannot be lost! It cannot be lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant! So many of our men are dead or wounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.95,0:14:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and the rest have already fled down the mountain to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Spineless cowards fleeing in the face of battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.91,0:14:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you kill them? Why didn't you kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The men are all exhausted!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant! Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.09,0:14:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't, Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.82,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We will help you break through the encirclement!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:15:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go back! Jieting is lost! I cannot go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! Adjutant, the Wei troops are advancing up the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Old bastard Sima...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.83,0:15:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! Which commander are you all serving under?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.09,0:15:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We are Adjutant Ma's men, returning to the main camp to report...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Report what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wei army surrounded our mountain and attacked with fire! Jieting is lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jieting is lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals Gao Xiang and Wei Yan were sent to assist,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.93,0:15:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but have been defeated by the Wei forces. Chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:15:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Xing, Zhang Bao!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:15:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,At your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take three thousand troops each and proceed along the side road of Mount Wugong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see any Wei soldiers, bang your drums and shout to create the illusion of a larger force
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.74,0:16:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and scare the enemy. \NDo not engage in direct battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the Wei army retreats fully, swiftly withdraw to Yangping Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Yi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Present, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take troops to prepare the gallery road for our retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.89,0:16:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei, Ma Dai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,At your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you bring your detachments to guard our rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lie in ambush in the mountain valleys first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for the rest of the army to retreat fully, \Nthen you may withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Clerk Yang!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dispatch messengers to inform the officials, soldiers, and civilians
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.51,0:16:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Tianshui, Nanan, and Anding commanderies to swiftly withdraw to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Also send a trusted confidant to Ji county to escort Jiang Wei's elderly mother into Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Zhang Yi! \N-At your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:17:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall accompany me with five thousand troops
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and retreat to Xi county to retrieve our provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.38,0:17:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.61,0:18:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we not press our victory
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and march straight to Yangping Pass, opening the gates to Shu proper?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minor victory at Jieting was merely a stroke of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.79,0:18:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is not an average commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.09,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If we attack Yangping Pass, \Nhe will strike us from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,An assault from both front and rear will lead to our defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why does father lead an army of a hundred and fifty thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.19,0:18:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to capture the remote and insignificant Xi county?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.43,0:18:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Xi county is small, it serves as the supply depot for the Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, it lies on the crossroads to Nan'an, Tianshui, and Anding commanderies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When Xi county is recaptured, the commanderies can also be reclaimed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.25,0:18:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You, take the vanguard and proceed to scout Xi county.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Be cautious of ambushes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You, have light cavalry to guard our flanks
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and look out for any movements from the Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:18:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall advance steadily and march straight to Xi county!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.22,0:19:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We must transport our provisions back to Hanzhong, let none be left for the Wei army.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.62,0:19:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Have them all loaded while the Wei army hasn't arrived yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we had begun loading upon receiving your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.01,0:19:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Half of our carts have been fully loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Sima's army of 150,000 are coming straight to Xi county!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.15,0:19:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up the supply ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Conceal all the banners and flags on the city walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the guardsmen, anyone who moves about or speaks loudly will be executed on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.67,0:20:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be no rash behavior when the Wei army arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.32,0:21:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.75,0:21:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, look! Zhuge Liang!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.01,0:22:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is acting audacious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we charge straight into the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.88,0:22:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed! Father, let's charge straight inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.98,0:22:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not act recklessly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.72,0:23:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}This crisp sound evokes the fierce waves crashing against the shore,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.21,0:23:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}and wind sweeping away scattered clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}as if one has a mighty army of a million men at his fingertip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.92,0:23:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Father, why can't I hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.78,0:23:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.27,0:23:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}the music is like a mountain stream, clean and transparent to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Only a calm mind can achieve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Zhuge Liang must have everything planned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.32,0:24:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Father, how can a few simple {\i1}qin{\i0} strings
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.29,0:24:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}convey such profound meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.28,0:24:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}When the mind is disturbed, the sound is dissonant; \NWhen the mind is calm, the sound is crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.20,0:24:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}When the mind is anxious, the sound is inaccurate; \NWhen the mind is serene, the sound is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.97,0:24:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Listening to Zhuge Liang play the {\i1}qin{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.33,0:24:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}is to listen to his inner thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I am honored to be able to understand Zhuge Liang so intimately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Pass my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.00,0:24:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Our rear troops will become the front; \Nwe retreat to the northern mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.09,0:24:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Father, why are we retreating?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.04,0:24:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Know that Zhuge Liang was always a cautious military commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}not one to take major risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.72,0:24:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Now look upon the open gates \Nand suspicious lack of soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.82,0:24:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}There must be an ambush in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.52,0:24:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Furthermore, Zhuge Liang's {\i1}qin{\i0} music is suffused with deadly intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.07,0:24:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}If we enter the city, we will fall into his trap for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.64,0:25:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.38,0:25:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.72,0:25:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.20,0:25:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.45,0:25:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi's forces have retreated!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.83,0:25:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Ah, what a perilous tactic!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.73,0:25:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Alas, we had to use it out of necessity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Chancellor, if it were us, we would definitely have fled the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.98,0:25:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the military officers dispatched, the city only contains civil officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.91,0:25:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have two thousand soldiers at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.88,0:26:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were to flee the city, it wouldn't be long before Sima Yi catches us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.85,0:26:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Have our provisions been loaded?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.33,0:26:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the carts are loaded and ready to set off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.12,0:26:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Take them to Hanzhong at once! \N-Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.94,0:26:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the civilians of Xi to accompany our troops to Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.30,0:26:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.84,0:26:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is bound to return before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.00,0:26:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Chancellor, but why haven't we seen your main force anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.07,0:26:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What force?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That was nothing more than an empty city and the melody of a zither.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.52,0:26:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall quickly return to Hanzhong with our provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.12,0:27:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ingenious...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.93,0:27:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How ingenious....
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.17,0:27:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Ma Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.97,0:27:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Ma Su recognizes the severity of his crimes
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.87,0:27:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and has already tied himself up outside the hall, awaiting your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.74,0:27:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.19,0:27:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The guilty general Ma Su greets the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.92,0:27:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.84,0:27:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,in whose hands is Jieting now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.57,0:27:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You offered your entire family's lives as collateral,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.16,0:28:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,so that you could lead the defense of Jieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.58,0:28:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what happened to Jieting?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.41,0:28:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the loss of Jieting is Ma Su's full responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.87,0:28:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You confess to your crime, but what use is it now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.69,0:28:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you repeatedly,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.86,0:28:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jieting is the cornerstone of our expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.43,0:28:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If it is lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.07,0:28:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,our forces can neither advance nor retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.21,0:28:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Our three hundred thousand strong army nearly perished at your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.95,0:28:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were receiving your orders, I admonished you again and again
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.75,0:28:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,to make camp on the route \Nand intercept the Wei forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.76,0:28:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, to make camp on the route!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.06,0:28:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you were determined not to listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.39,0:28:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking yourself so well-versed in strategy from reading books
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.96,0:28:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,that you insist on camping on a mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.61,0:28:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wang tried so hard to persuade you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.68,0:29:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you had heeded even a fraction of his advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.27,0:29:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you have brought about such a disaster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.47,0:29:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.61,0:29:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our first military expedition of Mount Qi, \Nour first offensive into Wei!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.04,0:29:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Three hundred thousand men fought valiantly while enduring hardship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.56,0:29:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Every soldier pressed onward without hesitation, and every general gave their utmost effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.95,0:29:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then could we capture three commanderies,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.03,0:29:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,reach the Wei river, and secure a path to Chang'an!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.46,0:29:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when we were on the verge of a great victory...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.40,0:29:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You... You chose to be stubborn and arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.58,0:29:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Jieting is lost, we've taken heavy casualties, \Nand the captured territories are forfeit!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.77,0:29:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All of this is your responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.51,0:29:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.28,0:29:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you bear such a colossal crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.05,0:29:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Ma Su is willing to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.86,0:30:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When you received your orders, you made a pledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.73,0:30:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,that your entire family would be executed if Jieting were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.07,0:30:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In light of your long years of service alongside me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.14,0:30:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and your many commendable tactical contributions,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.04,0:30:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I will pardon your family from execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.45,0:30:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.78,0:30:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The debacle at Jieting, however, was a severe violation of military law,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.32,0:30:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and you cannot escape accountability.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do not uphold military discipline properly, \Nhow can I retain our soldiers' respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.93,0:30:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Guards! \N-Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.76,0:30:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.46,0:30:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret not heeding the Chancellor's words
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.74,0:30:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and General Wang's advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.24,0:30:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,resulting in the defeat at Jieting and the failure of the expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.41,0:30:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,For my grave sin, I know that death is unavoidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.29,0:31:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I only hope that the Chancellor will kindly look after my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them have enough food and clothing in times of need.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.47,0:31:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.44,0:31:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Youchang, our bond is like that of brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.71,0:31:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your children are my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.16,0:31:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,After your death,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.18,0:31:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,your entire family will receive a monthly stipend of grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.52,0:31:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You do not have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.46,0:31:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.02,0:32:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Su bids farewell to you and my fellow generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.06,0:32:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,though Ma Su has committed a capital offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.06,0:32:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,his unwavering loyalty has never been in doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.13,0:32:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let him redeem himself through meritorious service!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.37,0:32:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, nothing more needs to be said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.91,0:32:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.23,0:32:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.71,0:32:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please spare him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.15,0:32:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.35,0:32:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjutant?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.22,0:32:46.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(333.333,402.667)}Jiǎng Wǎn\NStyled: Gōngyǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.89,0:32:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The world remains uncertain,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.66,0:32:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,is it not a shame to execute a talented strategist?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.59,0:32:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Jiang Wan has come all the way here from Chengdu,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.48,0:32:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,all to implore the Chancellor to spare Ma Su's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.77,0:33:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Military law is unforgiving and cannot be disregarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.94,0:33:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Without justice in rewards and punishments, \Nhow can we lead our armies into battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.92,0:33:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or fulfill the dying wish of the Late Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.72,0:33:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation has come to this point, and there is nothing more we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.03,0:33:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.86,0:33:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.94,0:34:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Ma Su deserved to be executed for his crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.95,0:34:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need for the Chancellor to be so mournful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.68,0:34:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not crying for Ma Su.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.49,0:35:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Late Emperor neared death at Baidi city...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.03,0:35:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He warned me...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.27,0:35:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Su's talents were exaggerated and cannot be too relied upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.71,0:35:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas! His words were proven true today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.45,0:35:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret my own foolishness,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.72,0:35:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've harmed both our army,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.52,0:35:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and harmed Youchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.12,0:35:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am ashamed before the Late Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.13,0:35:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and feel crushed by guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.04,0:35:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I will formally request a demotion of three ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.43,0:35:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and dismissal from my position of Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.31,0:35:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, victory and defeat both are part of warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.72,0:36:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.12,0:36:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Lax military discipline,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.23,0:36:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and inappropriate appointments,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.73,0:36:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,led to the defeat at Jieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.36,0:36:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,These were my faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.84,0:36:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who govern must uphold the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.88,0:36:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If the law is not upheld, how can one command the respect of the governed?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.38,0:36:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Faced with such a defeat, how can I demonstrate reverence for the law
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.55,0:36:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,without a voluntary demotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.83,0:36:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.38,0:36:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,regardless of rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.73,0:36:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,if you see Liang mismanaging the army or other affairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.97,0:36:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you will offer advice with candid words,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.58,0:37:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so that our forces can conquer the Central Plains soon
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.18,0:37:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and restore the great Han dynasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.85,0:37:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.09,0:37:12.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the interest of upholding military discipline, \NZhuge Liang tearfully ordered the execution of Ma Su
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.90,0:37:16.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and formally requested a voluntary demotion for Emperor Liu Shan to assess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.16,0:37:20.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang was demoted to the position of General on the Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.06,0:37:21.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,but allowed to continue the duties of Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.94,0:37:24.48,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and retain full command of the military as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.51,0:37:28.20,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Thereafter, Zhuge Liang diligently trained troops in Hanzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.22,0:37:31.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,awaiting the chance to launch another Northern Expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.10,0:37:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Our army is refreshed and prepared for battle. \NWith our supplies abundant and strength formidable,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.69,0:37:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we were just considering an offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.75,0:37:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Eastern Wu has recently dealt a heavy defeat to the Wei army,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.44,0:37:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,this is our chance for another Northern Expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.16,0:37:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.68,0:37:51.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(309.333,442.667)}Fèi Yī\NStyled: Wénwěi
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.49,0:37:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet, the Northern Expedition is still controversial with the officials of the Imperial Court.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.83,0:37:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Many have said that Cao Wei is powerful and should not be taken lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.11,0:38:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall submit another petition to the Emperor to strongly argue this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.35,0:38:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Zhao Tong and Zhao Guang,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.98,0:38:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the sons of General Zhao Yun, have arrived in mourning attire.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.74,0:38:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.46,0:38:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our father passed away from illness last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.50,0:38:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Chancellor, our father said in his death-bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.77,0:38:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,he cannot join the army to war against Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.61,0:38:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and cannot rest even on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.51,0:38:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.30,0:38:47.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(968,500)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.32,0:38:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, I was beginning another Northern Expedition,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.66,0:38:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.36,0:38:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.40,0:39:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise, esteemed youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.44,0:39:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.61,0:39:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,With Zilong's passing, our nation has lost an important pillar of support,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.58,0:39:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have lost an arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.72,0:39:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What profound sorrow for us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.77,0:39:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring them to Chengdu to announce his passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.90,0:39:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.21,0:39:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.66,0:40:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong! Zilong!

